[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 16: set_db route_design_with_si_driven false
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 17: set_db route_design_detail_on_grid_only None
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 18: set_db route_design_strict_honor_route_rule true
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @file 19: #the tool will only do post-route via optimization and all normal routing will be SKIPPED
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 20: set_db route_design_detail_use_multi_cut_via_effort high
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 21: set_db route_design_concurrent_minimize_via_count_effort high
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 22: set_db route_design_detail_fix_antenna true
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @file 23: ### The router runs search-and-repair routing during detailed routing. During search and repair, it locates shorts and spacing violations and reroutes the affected areas to eliminate as many of the violations as possible.
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @file 24: ### Runs a search-and-repair step after the initial detailed routing.
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 25: set_db route_design_detail_search_and_repair true
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @file 26: ### search and repair number of iterations
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 27: set_db route_design_detail_end_iteration 20
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @file 28: ### Antenna fixing settings
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 29: set_db route_design_detail_fix_antenna true
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @@file 30: set_db route_design_antenna_diode_insertion true
[03/22 14:12:54    116s] @file 31: ### Inserts diodes to repair process antenna violations on clock nets that are in the regular net section of the DEF file.
